Track 1: Meridian of the Singed Compass
- Story & Context: The broadcast began when Valeriu tripped the emergency shunt at the station, causing the mountain pass to hum with a sickening, delicious static. A sudden flash of white light scorched his favorite velvet jacket, turning the wool into carbonized lace while the music roared to life. "Point the needle toward the burning North," he screamed over the drum-shatter, realizing for the first time that the sky was speaking back.
